{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10644030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10644030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1064403001:0":{"text":"宴会大厅温暖如春，长桌上摆满了烤鹿肉、可口点心和来自南方的水果。","source_cn":"宴会大厅温暖如春，长桌上摆满了烤鹿肉、可口点心和来自南...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x829B3C6E1A20F5CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064403002:0":{"text":"乐师们弹奏着轻快的旋律，领主斯诺倚靠在主位，怀抱两名美人，面色因酒意而泛红。","source_cn":"乐师们弹奏着轻快的旋律，领主斯诺倚靠在主位，怀抱两名美...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC24C8AD31269383","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064403003:0":{"text":"噢——阿尔娜，你可迟到了，坐下暖和暖和，北地的英雄理应享受美酒。","source_cn":"噢——阿尔娜，你可迟到了，坐下暖和暖和，北地的英雄理应...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFACC92274660BB91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064403004:0":{"text":"斯诺大人，军务紧急，我有要事禀报。","source_cn":"斯诺大人，军务紧急，我有要事禀报。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF06A6B5C831A8020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064403005:1":{"text":"我听说了，南方来了些流民，为了进城，夸大其词也是常情。","source_cn":"我听说了，南方来了些流民，为了进城，夸大其词也是常情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB582CFAEA0DB68CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docum